@startuml
title Beacon state proof chain, from the EIP-4788 root to a Validator field
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component { 
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}
component "EIP-4788 contract\nslot T % 8191: timestamp\nslot T % 8191 + 8191: root" as C4788
component "BeaconBlockHeader (root = hash_tree_root of the parent beacon block)\nslot 8, proposer_index 9, parent_root 10, state_root 11, body_root 12" as H
component "BeaconState\nDeneb 32+i, Electra and Fulu 64+i, Gloas progressive" as S
component "validators list root\ndata 2, length 3" as L
component "Validator element\n2**40 + i until Fulu, progressive position in Gloas" as E
component "Validator field\npubkey 8 ... withdrawable_epoch 15" as V
C4788 --> H : block root
H --> S : state_root (3 siblings)
S --> L : field (fork dependent)
L --> E : list path
E --> V : 3 siblings
note right of S
  Only this step and the list step
  change with the forks
end note
@enduml
